description: TypeScript and service-layer standards
globs: src/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# TypeScript

- Strict typing; avoid `any`.
- Put shared domain types in `src/types`.
- Put HTTP/SSE I/O in `src/services`; keep React components free of raw `fetch`.
- Use Zustand stores for shared mutable UI state.
- Prefer named exports except for page/app entry components.
- Handle errors with typed/domain errors when crossing service boundaries.
